UID:cinemagic-20261108T190000-the-return-of-captain-invincible-1983@small-s
 creens-pdx
DTSTAMP:20261104T202843Z
DTSTART:20261109T030000Z
DTEND:20261109T043600Z
SUMMARY:The Return of Captain Invincible (1983)
LOCATION:The Cinemagic Theater\, 2021 SE Hawthorne Blvd\, Portland OR
GEO:45.5122;-122.6366
DESCRIPTION:Dir. Philippe Mora · 96 min\n\nIn WWII\, Captain Invincible us
 ed his superpowers against the Nazis and was hailed as a hero. But when he
  was accused of treason\, he retired to Australia in disgrace. Cut to the 
 present\, when a US super secret super weapon is stolen and he's asked to 
