SUMMARY:Stop Making Sense (1984)
LOCATION:Academy Theater\, 7818 SE Stark St\, Portland OR
GEO:45.5191;-122.5829
DESCRIPTION:Dir. Jonathan Demme · 88 min\n\nA concert film documenting Tal
 king Heads at the height of their popularity\, on tour for their 1983 albu
 m "Speaking in Tongues." The band takes the stage one by one and is joined
  by a cadre of guest musicians for a career-spanning and cinematic perform
 ance that features creative choreography and visuals.\n\nTickets: https://
 booking.academytheaterpdx.com/launch/ticketing/98c53e9f-9cf3-568b-a554-f79
 4e21d5ca3\n\nMore showtimes: https://mattlohkamp.github.io/small-screens-p
 dx/
URL:https://booking.academytheaterpdx.com/launch/ticketing/98c53e9f-9cf3-56
 8b-a554-f794e21d5ca3
END:VEVENT
